ecision platformer:</strong><br>Collect all targets as fast as you can - but beware of the deadly hazards.<br></li><li><strong>Challenging and rewarding:</strong><br>Prepare to crash. A lot. Instant respawns will get you going again in no time and a hard-earned victory tastes all the sweeter!<br></li><li><strong>Test your skills in different settings:</strong><br>From an abandoned space station to the icy worlds of the Frost Empire, discover new mechanics and hazards in the first 4 worlds before unlocking the hidden 5th world and its 18 additional levels!<br></li><li><strong>Survive epic Boss Battles:</strong><br>Evil Egg will hunt you in extra challenging, dynamic boss levels at the end of each world. Defeat him to move along!<br></li><li><strong>There is no easy mode in Turbo Shell</strong><br>\u2026 but if Normal and Hard mode aren\u2019t enough, why not unlock Nightmare mode to get the full eggsperience!<br></li><li><strong>Feel the rhythm:</strong><br>Enjoy the arcadey retro experience with a driving synthwave soundtrack by Pete Frogs.<br></li><li><strong>Gotta hatch \u2018em all!</strong><br>They need your help! Find and unlock a colorful roster of characters to play as.<br></li><li><strong>Climb global Leaderboards:</strong><br>Place a rank in the global leaderboards. Watch runs from the world's best players and beat their ghosts head-to-head.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1565880/extras/d9770a638b7748974aea4d7557f02a63.poster.avif?t=1684854029\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1565880/extras/d9770a638b7748974aea4d7557f02a63.webm?t=1684854029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1565880/extras/d9770a638b7748974aea4d7557f02a63.mp4?t=1684854029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
